From: UN1CA <unica@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Honor the power sound toggle during shutdown

Keep Samsung volume, silent-shutdown and audio cleanup paths intact.

--- a/smali_classes2/com/android/server/power/shutdown/SoundPlayer.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/android/server/power/shutdown/SoundPlayer.smali
@@ -248,6 +248,16 @@
     move-object v3, v5
 
     :goto_1
+    const-string v6, "persist.sys.unica.bootsound"
+
+    const/4 v7, 0x1
+
+    invoke-static {v6, v7}, Landroid/os/SystemProperties;->getBoolean(Ljava/lang/String;Z)Z
+
+    move-result v6
+
+    if-eqz v6, :cond_a
+
     iget-boolean v6, p0, Lcom/android/server/power/shutdown/SoundPlayer;->silentShutdown:Z
 
     if-nez v6, :cond_a
